This repository is an independently maintained integration project. It does not
claim authorship of Casdoor or imply endorsement by its developers. Casdoor modifications are
distributed as an ordered patch series, with the exact upstream revision and
checksums in upstream.lock.json. Prepared source records every modified path in
integration-provenance.json. Go dependency manifests, the frontend package
manifest and Yarn lockfile contain integration dependency updates. The example
server configuration is derived from upstream and marked as modified.

The ACME integration uses go-acme/lego (MIT); its licence is in licenses/Lego-MIT.txt.
